stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ResolveInvestigator
    ResolveInvestigator --> Investigate: агент запинен один раз
    Investigate --> Failed: phase != Succeeded
    Investigate --> AwaitApproval: Succeeded
    AwaitApproval --> ResolveImplementer: approve()
    ResolveImplementer --> Implement: service = repo этого issue
    Implement --> Done
    Failed --> [*]
    Done --> [*]

    note right of AwaitApproval
      wait_condition — ждём сигнала сколько угодно.
      approve() НЕ флипает .status.yaml:
      proposed → accepted руками в gitops,
      иначе implement-CWFT no-op (skipped_reason)
    end note
